atrix of our differential equation is diagonal, the system is decoupled. \n\nTherefore, the general solution is given by\n![](images/1b/1b43b7c5f8459588632917502c96bb792a86a9f8e6c3a2d67eda71c6ce56f496.svg)"} :knowledge-point/id #uuid "3d04ce85-c364-52ba-aa30-ca47e307496e" :knowledge-point/questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186157783 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1e9a8c81-a091-545d-84fc-e0dd993ec18b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x(t)={c}_{1}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}{e}^{2t}+{c}_{2}\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}t{e}^{2t},\\,{c}_{1},{c}_{2}\\in R" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186345621} {:answer/id #uuid "434dca2b-bb1e-5b6a-a0fc-484d397d614c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x(t)={c}_{1}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}{e}^{2t}+{c}_{2}\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}{e}^{-2t},\\,{c}_{1},{c}_{2}\\in R" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186345932} {:answer/id #uuid "581d572d-6189-5f30-8179-ad07a3ead556" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x(t)={c}_{1}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}{e}^{2t}+{c}_{2}\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}{e}^{2t},\\,{c}_{1},{c}_{2}\\in R" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186346102} {:answer/id #uuid "6c04748c-785f-5be6-8f54-c3dd0b0f7a20" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x(t)={c}_{1}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}{e}^{2t},\\,{c}_{1}\\in R" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186346288} {:answer/id #uuid "ef0a53e5-676f-5cb8-9cd4-65e20571d1dd" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x(t)={c}_{1}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}{e}^{-2t}\\,{c}_{1}\\in R" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186347460}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x(t)={c}_{1}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}{e}^{2t}+{c}_{2}\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}{e}^{2t},\\,{c}_{1},{c}_{2}\\in R" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186346102} :answer-field/id #uuid "5d1be337-4b04-5f96-942e-67689c075869" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186347765}] :question/id #uuid "c1a7a31a-a1ff-52db-b87c-67b3aaf6bbd0" :question/math-academy-id "q-80548" :question/problem "Find the general solution to the matrix differential equation $\\,{x}^{′}(t)=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 2\\end{bmatrix}x(t).$" :question/worked-solution "Given a decoupled system of first-order linear ODEs in the form\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1}^{′}(t) \\\\ {x}_{2}^{′}(t)\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}\\lambda  & 0 \\\\ 0 & \\lambda \\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1}(t) \\\\ {x}_{2}(t)\\end{bmatrix},\n$$\n\nthe formula for the general solution is\n\n$$\nx(t)={c}_{1}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}{e}^{\\lambda t}+{c}_{2}\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}{e}^{\\lambda t},\\,{c}_{1},{c}_{2}\\in R.\n$$\n\nSince the matrix of our differential equation is diagonal, the system is decoupled. \n\nTherefore, the general solution is given by\n\n$$\nx(t)={c}_{1}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}{e}^{2t}+{c}_{2}\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}{e}^{2t},\\,{c}_{1},{c}_{2}\\in R.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186157784 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a8d8d43a-0538-5868-8426-49bfbebb5b8f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x(t) = c_{1}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}e^{-3t} + c_{2}\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}e^{3t}, c_{1}, c_{2} ∈ R" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186155626} {:answer/id #uuid "fd561849-feb8-5040-83d1-0f46c0245f5f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x(t) = c_{1}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}e^{3t}c_{1} ∈ R" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186155627} {:answer/id #uuid "0a0d812a-925a-5202-8cfe-e01c924ef4fb" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x(t) = c_{1}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}e^{-3t}, c_{1} ∈ R" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186155628} {:answer/id #uuid "39962cf7-906f-561e-90b7-74817592796b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x(t) = c_{1}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}te^{-3t} + c_{2}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}e^{-3t}, c_{1}, c_{2} ∈ R" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186155629} {:answer/id #uuid "5a7950ab-9f8e-5f90-9fc5-6a2d89ccc263" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x(t) = c_{1}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}e^{-3t} + c_{2}\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}e^{-3t}, c_{1}, c_{2} ∈ R" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186155630}] :answer-field/id #uuid "cda1e580-a637-50de-9254-dacba1f58221" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186155625}] :question/id #uuid "480e0cf5-dde8-521e-a700-1f0aa078fd13" :question/math-academy-id "q-80600" :question/problem "Find the general solution to the matrix differential equation $x^{′}(t) = \\begin{bmatrix}-3 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -3\\end{bmatrix}x(t)$."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186302265 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0422cb11-aa21-5804-a176-05ed17cba41e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x(t)={c}_{1}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}{e}^{-1.7t}\\,{c}_{1}\\in R" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299947} {:answer/id #uuid "0f4d7c35-78bf-5342-a653-ea1a2987432b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x(t)={c}_{1}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}{e}^{1.7t}+{c}_{2}\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}{e}^{-1.7t},\\,{c}_{1},{c}_{2}\\in R" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186300020} {:answer/id #uuid "31004e1e-f5f2-5c84-942a-fc521ec76c10" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x(t)={c}_{1}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}t{e}^{1.7t}+{c}_{2}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}{e}^{1.7t},\\,{c}_{1},{c}_{2}\\in R" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186300199} {:answer/id #uuid "c77c5882-e733-5d04-8246-4ccb1fd85e4b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x(t)={c}_{1}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}{e}^{1.7t}+{c}_{2}\\begin{