rked-solution "First, notice that both $x$ and $y$ appear in each equation, all the variables are on the left-hand side, and all the constants are on the right-hand side.\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}-3x+4y &=10 \\\\ 5x+2y &=-7\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nNow, we can write the system in the form $Ax=b,$ where\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & 4 \\\\ 5 & 2\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nis the coefficient matrix,\n\n$$\nb=\\begin{bmatrix}10 \\\\ -7\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nis the column vector of constants, and\n\n$$\nx=\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nis the column vector of variables.\n\nSo, the equation $Ax=b$ becomes\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & 4 \\\\ 5 & 2\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}10 \\\\ -7\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186299609 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "cb708238-1c4f-5e19-b952-7a1cae1199fc" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298437}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298437} :answer-field/id #uuid "10c56e2f-c0ae-54bc-ae0e-78956ef2054b" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298696} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0ffca954-c164-5a2e-875b-0abd28c1ee63" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186297624}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186297624} :answer-field/id #uuid "16089658-2d6e-598a-a69c-59786030f56b" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298719} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "c1e3aeae-9a20-54b1-bcf6-e179312cdfb3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298403}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type