 --- | --- |\n|  | {{field-4}} |  | |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  | {{field-1}} | {{field-2}} |  |  |  |  |\n|  | {{field-3}} | $-5$ |  |  |  |  |\n|  | $x$ |  |  |  |  |  |\n|  | $y$ |  |  |  |  |  |\n|  | $9$ |  |  |  |  |  |\n|  | {{field-4}} |  |  |  |  |  |\n\n." :question/worked-solution "First, we organize the system so that it is in the correct order and both $x$ and $y$ appear in each equation:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}-2x+y &=9 \\\\ 0x-5y &=-15\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nNow, we can write the system in the form $Ax=b,$ where\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & -5\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nis the coefficient matrix,\n\n$$\nb=\\begin{bmatrix}9 \\\\ -15\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nis the column vector of constants, and\n\n$$\nx=\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nis the column vector of variables.\n\nSo, the equation $Ax=b$ becomes\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & -5\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}9 \\\\ -15\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186299618 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4594da98-1c2a-54d9-8a10-751dc6d6a248" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "9" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186297837}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "9" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186297837} :answer-field/id #uuid "10cf71a3-1902-5e22-a831-1fd47e406b59" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298697} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "9c8b4bec-ca96-58d1-b394-40b30e168da4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298237}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298237} :answer-field/id #uuid "aa5be443-392a-5f65-a6a9-f11df9b70cc9" :answer-field/key "field-4" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299212} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0fe58c66-d1d9-590f-a96b-927875901a80" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186297623}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186297623} :answer-field/id #uuid "b89b4d3f-1939-5756-b8ce-99a1e27fc048" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299261} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "f3e2b4b0-4685-5ae3-bafc-e5d93e75a043" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298584}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298584} :answer-field/id #uuid "ce53df6e-e873-51c6-b370-bb132a5e6f60" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299330}] :question/id #uuid "ee62c6ba-71ac-57ec-bfe8-410ce9e1a842" :question/math-academy-id "q-317536" :question/problem "For the following system of equations\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}4y-x &=3 \\\\ 9y+2x &=5,\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nits representation using matrices is\n\n| |  | {{field-1}} | $4$ |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  | {{field-2}} | {{field-3}} |  | |  |  |  | |  | $x$ |  |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n|  | $y$ |  | | $=$ | |  | {{field-4}} |  |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n|  | $5$ |  | |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  | {{field-1}} | $4$ |  |  |  |  |\n|  | {{field-2}} | {{field-3}} |  |  |  |  |\n|  | $x$ |  |  |  |  |  |\n|  | $y$ |  |  |  |  |  |\n|  | {{field-4}} |  |  |  |  |  |\n|  | $5$ |  |  |  |  |  |\n\n." :question/worked-solution "First, we organize the system so that it is in the correct order and both $x$ and $y$ appear in each equation:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}-x+4y &=3 \\\\ 2x+9y &=5\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nNow, we can write the system in the form $Ax=b,$ where\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 4 \\\\ 2 & 9\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nis the coefficient matrix,\n\n$$\nb=\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ 5\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nis the column vector of constants, and\n\n$$\nx=\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nis the column vector of variables.\n\nSo, the equation $Ax=b$ becomes\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 4 \\\\ 2 & 9\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ 5\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186299619 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "dbb4dbdb-c501-59e8-a1dd-8b0bd23d0eb2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298495}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298495} :answer-field/id #uuid "1389ccbd-1b7a-5cb1-88d4-2ed1133983fe" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298709} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4de79627-eef5-5970-8e2d-eb52b1f0edc1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186297875}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186297875} :answer-field/id #uuid "2b31d414-76e7-5210-916c-0c91bb636d73" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298788} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "ee7737ea-f780-5480-b74d-28a0673efadb" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298564}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298564} :answer-field/id #uuid "9ca17d4e-624f-5422-818c-6a97ee47e9d7" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299152} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "fb8f547b-4751-5ed3-a16b-868f68570f62" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298624}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298624} :answer-field/id #uuid "f5360a1e-9e7d-5e50-a64b-89bdb7d29784" :answer-field/key "field-4" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299464}] :question/id #uuid "042fab86-9bc5-5bac-af22-a67d3b6956f7" :question/math-academy-id "q-317540" :question/problem "For the following system of equations\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}4 &=x \\\\ -7 &=3+y\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nits representation using matrices is\n\n| |  | $1$ | {{field-1}} |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  | {{field-2}} | {{field-3}} |  | |  |  |  | |  | $x$ |  |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n|  | $y$ |  | | $=$ | |  | {{field-4}} |  |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n|  | $-10$ |  | |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  | $1$ | {{field-1}} |  |  |  |  |\n|  | {{field-2}} | {{field-3}} |  |  |  |  |\n|  | $x$ |  |  |  |  |  |\n|  | $y$ |  |  |  |  |  |\n|  | {{field-4}} |  |  |  |  |  |\n|  | $-10$ |  |  |  |  |  |\n\n." :question/worked-solution "First, we organize the system so that it’s in the correct order and both $x$ and $y$ appear in each equation:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x+0y &=4 \\\\ 0x+y &=-10\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nNow, we can write the system in the form $Ax=b,$ where\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nis the coefficient matrix,\n\n$$\nb=\\begin{bmatrix}4 \\\\ -10\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nis the column vector of constants, and\n\n$$\nx=\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nis the column vector of variables.\n\nSo, the equation $Ax=b$ becomes\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}4 \\\\ -10\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$"}] :knowledge-point/title "Representing a 2x2 System of Equations Using a Matrix Product by Reorganizing"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186115233 :knowledge-point/canonical-example {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186115064 :question/id #uuid "b87aa5eb-f689-5f34-baeb-f97c3f200552" :question/math-academy-id "e-4507" :question/problem "What is the system of equations represented by\n![](images/6f/6f0ddb43928e0d9f52ca2fe0f0ab578adfa986cba8179746bd34a50a1a7c506b.png)" :question/worked-solution "The  $2\\times 2$ matrix represents the coefficients of $x$ and $y,$ while the $2\\times 1$ column vector on the right-hand side represents the constants of the equations. So, we get the following system of equations:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}10x-15y &=5 \\\\ 1x+0y &=-2\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nSimplifying both equations in the system, we get\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}2x-3y &=1 \\\\ x &=-2.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$"} :knowledge-point/id #uuid "fe2300a1-f31e-5a24-889a-6f45e1e8647b" :knowledge-point/questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186115733 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "844af2ff-91bd-5774-977a-c4b75a56b7e7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}2x+5y &=-7 \\\\ x &=10\\end{aligned}\\right." :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298123} {:answer/id #uuid "ba86e523-ab11-5712-a0ef-e9273fbba9ba" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}2x-5y &=10 \\\\ y &=-7\\end{aligned}\\right." :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298364} {:answer/id #uuid "c0094f31-2ab1-54a0-a168-daab0cf20812" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}2x+5y &=10 \\\\ y &=-7\\end{aligned}\\right." :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298399} {:answer/id #uuid "f1959011-ff17-5b5f-bab6-775af7511c23" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}2x-5y &=-7 \\\\ x &=10\\end{aligned}\\right." :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298574} {:answer/id #uuid "f197b44a-bdc4-5917-8017-c00985501ea8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}2x-5y &=10 \\\\ x &=-7\\end{aligned}\\right." :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298575}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}2x-5y &=10 \\\\ x &=-7\\end{aligned}\\right." :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298575} :answer-field/id #uuid "62cbb4a6-4bc5-5953-a9a5-b4146109a185" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298969}] :question/id #uuid "d80073fa-9f5d-593f-a765-d5bf9c3d142b" :question/math-academy-id "q-31876" :question/problem "What is the system of equations represented by\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -5 \\\\ 1 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}10 \\\\ -7\\end{bmatrix}?\n$$" :question/worked-solution "The  $2\\times 2$ matrix represents the coefficients of $x$ and $y,$ while the $2\\times 1$ column vector on the right-hand side represents the constants of the equations. So, we get the following system of equations:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}2x-5y &=10 \\\\ x+0y &=-7\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nSimplifying both equations in the system, we get\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}2x-5y &=10 \\\\ x &=-7\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186115740 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "9c75a7b4-8cf8-5814-905e-316cf670a3c0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{3x + 2y = 1; x =-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186113407} {:answer/id #uuid "deda1f91-6fc0-5da8-bca9-765394cc5db3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{9x + 6y =-1; x =-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186113408} {:answer/id #uuid "f05adb6e-e4fd-54ee-a877-80be7e74409e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{3x + 2y =-1; x =-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186113409} {:answer/id #uuid "f761650d-2720-5b17-8f25-48a1bb41f74b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{9x + 6y = 3; x + y =-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186113410} {:answer/id #uuid "3b491284-60c9-534a-a93b-663a44d5a865" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{9x + 6y - 3 = 0; x - 2 = 0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186113411}] :answer-field/id #uuid "ca7d485d-e01a-5fee-be3e-8b54af74ae8a" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186113406}] :question/id #uuid "35b88fb0-9cd6-5ac5-a270-9cfdc3fa43ad" :question/math-academy-id "q-32020" :question/problem "What is the system of equations represented by\n$\\begin{bmatrix}9 & 6 \\\\ 1 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix} = \\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix}$?"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186265926 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1dcde906-c5fb-5fc0-b6a8-8961649a59ba" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{aligned}\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}10x+25y &=-15 \\\\ 12x+6y &=3\\end{aligned}\\right.\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186422754} {:answer/id #uuid "727892e1-58ea-5d36-b86b-82b51a10eb55" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{aligned}\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}2x+5y &=3 \\\\ 4x+y &=-2\\end{aligned}\\right.\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186422822} {:answer/id #uuid "a12e8848-d478-59a6-a4bb-c9297a758c18" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{aligned}\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}10x+25y &=-15 \\\\ 12x+3y &=6\\end{aligned}\\right.\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186422866} {:answer/id #uuid "b92215d8-8706-55a2-9e83-085b95ecb6b9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{aligned}\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}10x+5y &=-15 \\\\ 12x+3y &=6\\end{aligned}\\right.\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186422884} {:answer/id #uuid "e1575aa2-a070-55bb-b7a7-08d8f4d81a38" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{aligned}\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}2x+5y &=15 \\\\ 4x+y &=-6\\end{aligned}\\right.\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186422911}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{aligned}\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}2x+5y &=3 \\\\ 4x+y &=-2\\end{aligned}\\right.\\end{aligned}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186422822} :answer-field/id #uuid "0929e729-c74a-53df-b186-d608a6e127ca" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186265262}] :question/id #uuid "2e54120f-ad5a-5b0e-97ad-23133523c995" :question/math-academy-id "q-130523" :question/problem "What is the system of equations represented by\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}10 & 25 \\\\ 12 & 3\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}15 \\\\ -6\\end{bmatrix}?\n$$" :question/worked-solution "The  $2\\times 2$ matrix represents the coefficients of $x$ and $y,$ while the $2\\times 1$ column vector on the right-hand side represents the constants of the equations. So, we get the following system of equations:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}10x+25y &=15 \\\\ 12x+3y &=-6\\end{aligned}\\right.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSimplifying both equations in the system, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}2x+5y &=3 \\\\ 4x+y &=-2.\\end{aligned}\\right.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186265927 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0bec536f-f8a0-5917-8735-203411ca376c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}3x-4y &=-1 \\\\ x &=3\\end{aligned}\\right." :db/id #edb/ref 17592186263114} {:answer/id #uuid "13808937-e709-5baf-bd70-906d13045e3b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}3x-4y &=3 \\\\ x &=-1\\end{aligned}\\right." :db/id #edb/ref 17592186263183} {:answer/id #uuid "441d0ffb-ffd6-58ae-a17d-9d7d0730d034" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}3x-4y &=-1 \\\\ y &=3\\end{aligned}\\right." :db/id #edb/ref 17592186263599} {:answer/id #uuid "834d660c-f342-580a-bd90-9491af1021d1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}3y-4x &=-1 \\\\ y &=3\\end{aligned}\\right." :db/id #edb/ref 17592186264128} {:answer/id #uuid "e782c9a3-4077-58c9-8359-eecbb821497c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}3x-4y &=-3 \\\\ y &=1\\end{aligned}\\right." :db/id #edb/ref 17592186265016}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}3x-4y &=-1 \\\\ y &=3\\end{aligned}\\right." :db/id #edb/ref 17592186263599} :answer-field/id #uuid "71665118-325d-5577-b749-fff1dfd7861f" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186265439}] :question/id #uuid "d26bf48b-80cb-5dd2-a23e-0d3f566745b3" :question/math-academy-id "q-130525" :question/problem "What is the system of equations represented by\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}3 & -4 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix}?\n$$" :question/worked-solution "The  $2\\times 2$ matrix represents the coefficients of $x$ and $y,$ while the $2\\times 1$ column vector on the right-hand side represents the constants of the equations. So, we get the following system of equations:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}3x-4y &=-1 \\\\ 0x+y &=3\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nSimplifying both equations in the system, we get\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}3x-4y &=-1 \\\\ y &=3.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186299621 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "afa59dcb-f7ce-5c09-a4c8-22b3dd6c17f6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x-2y" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298317}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x-2y" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298317} :answer-field/id #uuid "558975f8-6e41-52d2-a81c-63a261f8cee1" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298926} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "ec1d54c2-8080-5c78-b74c-cea3bc22fc7a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2x-y" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298556}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2x-y" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298556} :answer-field/id #uuid "dd39ba45-0c63-53b1-89a4-29f995bbc06a" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299386}] :question/id #uuid "d9d91921-5228-5fa0-a7a6-2fcbc61ddda4" :question/math-academy-id "q-317563" :question/problem "What is the system of equations represented by\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}8 & -4 \\\\ -6 & 12\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}16 \\\\ -18\\end{bmatrix}?\n$$\n\nThe corresponding system of equations is\n\n| { | {{field-1}} | $=$ | $\\,4$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| {{field-2}} | $=$ | $\\,\\,3.$ |  |" :question/worked-solution "The $2\\times 2$ matrix encodes the coefficients of $x$ and $y$, and the $2\\times 1$ vector on the right gives the constants, so the system is\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}8x-4y &=16 \\\\ -6x+12y &=-18\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nDividing the first equation by $4$ and the second by $-6$ gives the simplified system\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}2x-y &=4 \\\\ x-2y &=3\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nwhich matches the entries shown above."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186299622 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "6c13d0ca-65a8-51a3-a5d1-a0920f6683b9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3x+2y" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298017}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3x+2y" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298017} :answer-field/id #uuid "4a629bbe-7d36-5b30-862e-39429be187c2" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298885} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "fc7c405e-3476-5c14-a227-d3f55c63a900" :ans