-field/id #uuid "e8ccb8e1-1b38-53eb-8622-5c815d1d251a" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299425}] :question/id #uuid "b07676ec-4252-579f-89b9-78b9cf7c6870" :question/math-academy-id "q-317582" :question/problem "What is the system of equations represented by\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}5 \\\\ -7\\end{bmatrix}?\n$$\n\nThe corresponding system of equations is\n\n| { | {{field-1}} | $=$ | $5$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| {{field-2}} | $=$ | $\\,\\,-7.$ |  |" :question/worked-solution "The  $2\\times 2$ matrix represents the coefficients of $x$ and $y,$ while the $2\\times 1$ column vector on the right-hand side represents the constants of the equations. So, we get the following system of equations:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}0x+1y &=5 \\\\ -1x+0y &=-7\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nSimplifying both equations in the system, we get\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}y &=5 \\\\ -x &=-7\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186299624 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "82829b2e-baf5-5fab-a903-a5316f8d9f1a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3x+2y" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298116}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3x+2y" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298116} :answer-field/id #uuid "23562a54-29b9-5cdd-98d6-f06cb96d7dd5" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298753} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "44d0b073-d74e-5949-bc02-d145609dc06c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5x" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186297834}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5x" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186297834} :answer-field/id #uuid "e2e2fcd2-15bf-58c4-b88d-698133875b26" :answer-field/key "field-1" :a